zapret2control (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete the production GUI migration to Qt 6 and KDE Kirigami.
  * Add centralized settings, theme and language selection, and adaptive tray icons.
  * Rework Blockcheck around dedicated systemd worker and recovery units.
  * Replace updater overlay with manifest-based staging and atomic directory exchange.
    Add persistent transaction journaling and service-aware crash recovery.
  * Harden archive validation and binary checksums; preserve user configuration,
    hostlists, custom scripts, and unknown legacy files.
  * Standardize application, executable, helper, desktop, Polkit, systemd, and
    package identifiers.
  * Expand regression coverage and Debian/Fedora package smoke tests.

